{"parse": {"title": "AR-2", "pageid": 89272, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AR-1\" title=\"AR-1\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AR-2</span><a href=\"/wiki/AR-3\" title=\"AR-3\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AR</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">2</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B5.B7.E6.BB.A9.E6.BC.AB.E6.AD.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"海滩漫步\">海滩漫步</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 海滩漫步</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Beach Walking</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沿着来时的路在海滩上漫步，所见的情景与方才并无不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>泥土只是泥土，沙砾只是沙砾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们都是物质世界的表象，与超验性相去甚远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但在海边散步有助于沉思真理——这是学派不成文的教义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>啊，刚刚经过的时候还没见着这群海鸥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>37，小心你旁边的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>受惊的鸟类扑扇翅膀飞起，抖落沙粒与羽毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而37只是顺手拂掉了落在纸上的杂物，满不在意地继续前行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到苏菲亚加快步子从后面追上她，37才抬起头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>怎么了，苏菲亚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>已经没事了。你有什么新发现吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>暂时没有，但我现在清醒多了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是的，海风不一定对真理有所助益，但它一定能暂时吹散困倦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然而下一秒，她就打了个大大的哈欠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>呼啊……好困……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众小孩Ⅰ：</div><div>瞧，是37！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众小孩Ⅰ：</div><div>你又在做什么有意思的证明吗？我可以听听吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-511901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-511901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-511901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众小孩Ⅱ：</div><div>噢……我们是不是该像210那样，称呼37为赫尔墨斯之星？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-511901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-511901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-511901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众小孩Ⅱ：</div><div>我是说，听起来这像一种敬称……好吧，下午好，37！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她们路过了一群正在玩耍的孩子，收获了热情的招呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大家都见过37为了研究做出的各种举动，对她捧着一本笔记在海边漫步见怪不怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>下午好。你们在跳房子吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>最好再远一点儿，否则海浪会把画好的线冲乱的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>海浪……海浪中的每滴水都在做圆周运动，当扬起的浪超过120°时，它们就会“哗”地破掉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>看来答案的数列和海浪也无关，究竟是什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她短暂地陷入了自己思想的困境之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>朝她们迎面走来的领袖恰巧打破了这一境况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>266，267……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>……哦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>领袖朝旁挪动步子，试图安静地让出道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>事情很少能如人们期望中那样发展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>6！你也在这儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你在散步吗？为什么要沿着海滩边走边计数？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>难道因为你是6，就要走6666步……但这个数字并没有那么好，我建议……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>6巧妙地转移了话题，并未对37提出的数发表意见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>……你为何不在研究室？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我发现了一些休留下的题目，正在和苏菲亚一块儿尝试着解出它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她愉快地扬了扬手中的笔记本，向6示意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>是的。这些题目基本上只是儿童游戏，我能保证37不会浪费太多时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——没错！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这就是我忽略掉的提示！多亏你，苏菲亚，我想到了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>正因为它们是游戏，所以只有亲自玩一遍，才能知道休的意思！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>已经有三个参与者，你，我，6也在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>领袖的头发丝几不可见地晃动了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>接下来我还有其他事务需要处理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>可是我们以前也常一块儿玩耍的，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>现在和往常也没有区别，因为时间不过是一条绳上的几个结，从哪头开始数都行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>不，不必了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说话的同时，6往后方退了一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是个巧妙的选择，暗示着对方对话应当就此结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但对37并不怎么管用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>好吧，那我申请使用这片海滩，以及召集愿意参与游戏的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我保证，它会在晚饭时间前结束的——但我不能忽视这个近在眼前的问题！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>可以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>6转而朝向苏菲亚，微微点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>请你负责检验37这项提案的可行性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>告辞了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他再次迈开脚步，忽然停顿了一秒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>从268开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>多谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被打断的散步终于得以继续，37也重回到思考中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>真是遗憾，6是我们中最擅长谜语的人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>以前他还会说一些有趣的话，现在他已经快变成一个移动的朗诵卷轴了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>6向来是学派的领导者。领袖总是需要公正，客观，正确且无可指摘的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>6只是在履行自己的责任，我们都有自己要做的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>嗯——那对我来说，现在要做的事就是解出这些习题的真意！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她高高扬起了那本面向儿童的游戏集。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对于承担了整座岛最重要研究的领航人来说，这不是一个合乎时宜的举动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……37。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>也许这些题目里根本就没有什么含义呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>唔？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37眨了眨眼，似乎不明白她在说些什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我的意思是，它们只是面向孩童的游戏，而你已经知道了每道习题的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你认为答案的数字组合拥有什么深意，但也许它们只是一些随机数。相比之下，我们还有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这番对话本该还有一些内容，关于人们的期望，关于职责和义务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可是海风突兀地盖过了她的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37也并未听见——也许她只是从不在意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>是那几个孩子，快看！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37望着远处，视野内新的存在吸引了她的全部注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>来吧，苏菲亚，抓紧时间，我去帮你问一问——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>等等，别跑太快……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话语追不上37扬起的衣角。她向来都是想到便去做的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自顾自地抛出点子，挥霍着灵感，却也能达到其他人无法企及的高度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当她在晚餐时急急忙忙丢下面包跑出房间，在场的人都倍感疑惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但只隔了一天，《关于“流溢”分布范围的初步猜想》就被递交，并得到验证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对询问，37给出的回答是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“喔，这不算什么，我只是突然注意到这和芝麻粒的排列有相似之处！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……这也是37。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她弯腰捡起一块埋在沙中的卵石，试着将它抛向远处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>石块擦过水面，勾起数圈涟漪，与一串回忆。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_ye\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>细弱的哭声撞在几何体光滑的表面，留下空洞的回音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而一阵急促的脚步遮去了所有动静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>苏菲亚，太好了，你在这！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我要给你一个东西，你一定会感兴趣的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37递出的是一个玻璃瓶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>瓶中卷起的纸条边缘参差不齐，似乎本是演算纸的一角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你不是一直想要知道你的灵魂数字吗？我看到了，我把它写了下来，就在这里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的语气一如既往地骄傲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是属于“质数”的，坚硬而刺眼的光辉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这段记忆被有意识地淡忘了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在记忆的最后，玻璃瓶在空中划出一道弧线，落入海面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当涟漪散去，一切都复归平静。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>苏菲亚，苏菲亚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>友人的呼唤让她恍然回神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>好极了，对这个游戏感兴趣的人比我想得还要多！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一会儿工夫，37就带着她找到的参与者回到这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她正充满信心，打算立刻开始进行尝试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>现在必要条件都凑齐了，只要按顺序完成游戏就好。从第一题开始！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你也会来帮忙见证吗，苏菲亚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……当然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我会为你们验证计算，勘校错误。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红发的除错师点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是的，并非每道题目都需要答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在她们都有自己要做的事。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AR-2"}}